  "details": "I'm encountering an issue where my Android-compatible VRChat avatar, created using VCC3. and SDK3.8.1*, is not visible to myself or other users when I access VRChat via my Quest.\n\nConversely, avatars I've created with VCC3. and SDK3.7.** or VCC4. and SDK3.8.1* display correctly.\n\nThis suggests that updating VCC may resolve the visibility issue for affected avatars.\n\nBelow is a relevant log entry from a friend who experienced this error:\n\n Error      -  [Behaviour] Error downloading avatar MURIYARIYUKATA/Security: Error loading asset bundle from ****: HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden",
